---
description: Prepare one writeInterpretation evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ExhibitionZone[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Write labels, introductions, and supporting text that are engaging without overstating evidence. Distinguish fact, attribution, and interpretation, preserve culturally sensitive context, and keep terminology consistent across the visitor journey. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
